# Exercise 2.20 — weather provider.
# The default provider is Open-Meteo; it needs no key and reads nothing from this file.
# To switch to OpenWeatherMap, set a key below and replace src/services/weather.js with the
# alternative in the next step. Any VITE_-prefixed variable is PUBLIC: Vite inlines it into the
# JavaScript bundle, so never put a real secret in one.
VITE_OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=
